{"date":"2025-06-23","startIndex":0,"messages":[{"id":"m_1b158a95d9924340bebd2958df580fec","sender":"her","text":"今天的风有一点像刚洗好的被子。","timestamp":1750671000,"time":"17:30:00","type":"文本","kind":"text","quote":{"sender":"her","text":"这一天没有什么大事，但很开心。","target":{"date":"2025-06-20","chunk":0,"id":"m_210968daeaded1dd6ffe22bbf557ac58"}}},{"id":"m_1c9011f405923453bd26e2627da977e4","sender":"me","text":"那我们把窗户开一小会儿。","timestamp":1750671037,"time":"17:30:37","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_26e3c4b78a9ad0682ef6ffd2efb6d9af","sender":"her","text":"路过一家小花店，想起你喜欢的颜色。","timestamp":1750671074,"time":"17:31:14","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_939b319dae46d1d800fe8acb39cce3b1","sender":"me","text":"留到周末，我们一起挑一束。","timestamp":1750671111,"time":"17:31:51","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_267f3be6d8caebb808c0ae374e2d828c","sender":"her","text":"刚煮好的面，第一口最好吃。","timestamp":1750671148,"time":"17:32:28","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_48b59935d1d9530de627a3d9fb0c9eb1","sender":"me","text":"等我两分钟，把葱花也留一点。","timestamp":1750671185,"time":"17:33:05","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_6143e5d92c01a971ba9fc01bdab97523","sender":"her","text":"今天路边的小房子，给你看。（程序插画演示）","timestamp":1750671222,"time":"17:33:42","type":"文本","kind":"image","media":[{"kind":"image","url":"chat-assets/756d3de9a5e76410d26d30cfd851f71ef27fedd04396446d592d885b8defc9ba.webp","thumb":"chat-assets/756d3de9a5e76410d26d30cfd851f71ef27fedd04396446d592d885b8defc9ba.webp","width":660,"height":528}]},{"id":"m_9290292007a89d53acae35cb3160db38","sender":"me","text":"你拍下来了吗？","timestamp":1750671259,"time":"17:34:19","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_b05c393368e9cd8a8006d04525097ad7","sender":"her","text":"拍了一张，有点歪，但是很好看。","timestamp":1750671296,"time":"17:34:56","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_503fed348a91388231c06acd01ed8489","sender":"me","text":"歪一点也没关系，是今天的样子。","timestamp":1750671333,"time":"17:35:33","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_4fac00fb6b3297e3c142c834af35e3b8","sender":"her","text":"一声轻轻的提示音。（合成音效，并非真人语音）","timestamp":1750671370,"time":"17:36:10","type":"文本","kind":"audio","media":[{"kind":"audio","url":"chat-assets/f421a82c97894339c36adbd27d366c4d937b8d5ee1df9c80438880f36a5cea43.wav"}]},{"id":"m_437acca2ee201ea2d237b0f9c995261c","sender":"me","text":"好，早餐我来准备。","timestamp":1750671407,"time":"17:36:47","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_54a3553785c68cf9bcf6f2c7d59551b6","sender":"her","text":"柠檬汽水还是要冰冰的。","timestamp":1750671444,"time":"17:37:24","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_dd87d29caf574c1a1781578eb2b7e2e4","sender":"me","text":"我选热可可，我们一人分对方一口。","timestamp":1750671481,"time":"17:38:01","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_92b3d6465212b8608962ce5c75267e4b","sender":"her","text":"这一天没有什么大事，但很开心。","timestamp":1750671518,"time":"17:38:38","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_b5af21fa7ea124f000d6d27779985cec","sender":"me","text":"分享一个占位链接。","timestamp":1750671555,"time":"17:39:15","type":"文本","kind":"text","link":{"url":"https://example.com/","title":"示例链接 · example.com"}},{"id":"m_5e700a9d7ded9da8ccecb82a7fd640a7","sender":"her","text":"书只看了两页，猫倒是睡了一下午。","timestamp":1750671592,"time":"17:39:52","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_e9015c317ec075d8bf3c9b0c248199c4","sender":"me","text":"两页也算数，慢慢看。","timestamp":1750671629,"time":"17:40:29","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_ad5a0240e108658077f1ce3f0c8b0aff","sender":"her","text":"雨停了，楼下的叶子亮晶晶。","timestamp":1750671666,"time":"17:41:06","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_353dd0ce305a90b38e46346d346e90d4","sender":"me","text":"穿好外套，我们下楼走走。","timestamp":1750671703,"time":"17:41:43","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_2ac416ad01089740320dc2c95615abae","sender":"her","text":"明天不用赶路，可以绕一点远。","timestamp":1750671740,"time":"17:42:20","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_4a47ab532bf221b82d84852e19c9286e","sender":"me","text":"听你的，顺路买一袋栗子。","timestamp":1750671777,"time":"17:42:57","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_a8471436bc165fb0ee5594b1c70e2850","sender":"her","text":"回家的时候记得抬头，有一弯月亮。","timestamp":1750671814,"time":"17:43:34","type":"文本","kind":"text"},{"id":"m_2a3e2438491cbac93435278953053ebc","sender":"me","text":"看见了。晚安，明天再见。","timestamp":1750671851,"time":"17:44:11","type":"文本","kind":"text"}]}
